  "_doc": "Registry of practisable languages. One entry per language the project can build a lexicon for. `levels` run easiest first; a word's `rating` is len(levels) - index, so the easiest level has the highest rating. `plugin` names a module in Profile/data/scripts/languages/. `tests.source` and `dictionary.source` name fetchers under Resources/Tests/data/fetch/ and Resources/Dictionary/data/fetch/. `duolingo` is the course code duome uses. Filled in by the Resources agent; read by everything else.",
